        "date": "2026-11-11T15:18:23Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): light-ground colour-vision palettes; dark title bars untouched\n\nReview of PR #838: protan/deutan and tritan kept their dark-tuned line\ninks on the light viewport, some at 1.01:1 (pale yellow feed, white open\nboundary). Each remap now has a light-ground set that keeps its eye's\nsurviving axis, passes the CIEDE2000 gate for that eye and clears 3:1\non the ground. The title-bar fill change is limited to light themes, so\ndark keeps egui's own values.\n\nRefs #698\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
